{"id":"6573583f2357d706","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain.md","title":"ZFC Pcf3 Cofinal Chain","display":"df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain — ZFC Pcf3 Cofinal Chain","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain — ZFC Pcf3 Cofinal Chain","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain — ZFC Pcf3 Cofinal Chain"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"280e7f496839f2d8\" href=\"?note=280e7f496839f2d8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\">\\(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"280e7f496839f2d8\" href=\"?note=280e7f496839f2d8\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}chain} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)=\\lambda\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S(A,J,\\vec f)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\bigl(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S(\\vec f(\\alpha),\\vec f(\\beta),A,J)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}chain} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)=\\lambda\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S(A,J,\\vec f)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\bigl(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S(\\vec f(\\alpha),\\vec f(\\beta),A,J)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The chain is strictly increasing in the same reduced-product order used by the cofinality clause.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product","status":"resolved","id":"280e7f496839f2d8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product","status":"resolved","id":"280e7f496839f2d8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-pcf2-cofinal-sequence-in-product]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f,\\alpha,\\beta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf3\\text{-}cofinal\\text{-}chain} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S(A,J,\\lambda,\\vec f)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\vec f)=\\lambda\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2CofinalSequenceInProduct}_S(A,J,\\vec f)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\bigl(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\to\n\\mathrm{PcfLessModuloIdeal}_S(\\vec f(\\alpha),\\vec f(\\beta),A,J)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1314,"backlinks":[{"id":"5a32c3b00cffaa99","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3CofinalChain}_S$ (cofinal-chain predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3060","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain.md|58-df-zfc-pcf3-cofinal-chain]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","280e7f496839f2d8","5582a281f15a33c2"]}